<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (LabSkin-AD represents a robust, physiologically relevant in vitro model of atopic dermatitis that captures key structural, molecular, and microbiological hallmarks of the disease. By combining controlled cytokine-induced inflammation with a full-thickness human skin equivalent capable of microbial colonisation, the model bridges an important gap between traditional preclinical systems and human disease.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
